{"id":"ln-l0-u1-07","track":"learner","pass_score":0.8,"title":{"ar":"الحروف: ن ه و ي","en":"Letters: ن ه و ي","fr":"Lettres : ن ه و ي"},"teach":[{"type":"text","text":"Letters 25–28 of 28. Look at the dots: they are what tells many letters apart."},{"type":"letter","ch":"ن","name":"noon","sound":"n","note":"A bowl with one dot above.","dots":"one dot above","forms":{"iso":"ن","fin":"‍ن","ini":"ن‍","med":"‍ن‍"},"word":{"ar":"نَجْمَة","en":"star"}},{"type":"letter","ch":"ه","name":"haa","sound":"h (as in 'hat')","note":"Changes shape a lot. Lowercase 'haa' = the soft, light h.","dots":"no dots","forms":{"iso":"ه","fin":"‍ه","ini":"ه‍","med":"‍ه‍"},"word":{"ar":"هِلَال","en":"crescent"}},{"type":"letter","ch":"و","name":"waaw","sound":"w (also the long vowel 'oo')","note":"A small loop with a tail. Does not connect forward.","dots":"no dots","forms":{"iso":"و","fin":"‍و"},"word":{"ar":"وَرْدَة","en":"rose"}},{"type":"letter","ch":"ي","name":"yaa","sound":"y (also the long vowel 'ee')","note":"A curved tail with two dots below.","dots":"two dots below","forms":{"iso":"ي","fin":"‍ي","ini":"ي‍","med":"‍ي‍"},"word":{"ar":"يَد","en":"hand"}}],"practice":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Which letter is called «noon»?","options":["ن","ي","ه","و"],"answer":0,"explain":"ن is called noon.","id":"ln-l0-u1-07_p1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"What is the name of this letter: ه","options":["yaa","noon","waaw","haa"],"answer":3,"explain":"ه is called haa.","id":"ln-l0-u1-07_p2"},{"type":"match","prompt":"Match each letter to its name","pairs":[["ن","noon"],["ه","haa"],["و","waaw"],["ي","yaa"]],"explain":"Look at the shape and the dots.","id":"ln-l0-u1-07_p3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"The word وَرْدَة means:","options":["star","crescent","hand","rose"],"answer":3,"explain":"وَرْدَة = rose. It starts with و.","id":"ln-l0-u1-07_p4"}],"quiz":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Which letter makes this sound: y (also the long vowel 'ee')","options":["ن","ه","ي","و"],"answer":2,"explain":"ي (yaa) = y (also the long vowel 'ee').","id":"ln-l0-u1-07_q1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"How many dots does ه have, and where?","options":["One dot below","No dots","Three dots above","Two dots above"],"answer":1,"explain":"ه has no dots.","id":"ln-l0-u1-07_q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"What is the name of this letter: و","options":["yaa","waaw","haa","noon"],"answer":1,"explain":"و is called waaw.","id":"ln-l0-u1-07_q3"},{"type":"tf","prompt":"True or false: ن is called \"noon\".","answer":true,"explain":"Correct, ن is noon.","id":"ln-l0-u1-07_q4"},{"type":"type","prompt":"Type the name of this letter (in English letters): ي","answers":["yaa"],"explain":"ي is called yaa.","id":"ln-l0-u1-07_q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"The word هِلَال means:","options":["star","crescent","rose","hand"],"answer":1,"explain":"هِلَال = crescent.","id":"ln-l0-u1-07_q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Which word starts with the letter و?","options":["نَجْمَة","وَرْدَة","يَد","هِلَال"],"answer":1,"explain":"وَرْدَة (rose) starts with و.","id":"ln-l0-u1-07_q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"What sound does ن make?","options":["n","y (also the long vowel 'ee')","w (also the long vowel 'oo')","h (as in 'hat')"],"answer":0,"explain":"ن (noon) = n.","id":"ln-l0-u1-07_q8"}]}